      "parameters": {
        "content": "DRAFT for import — runtime verification is BLOCKED until n8n and Telegram are configured.\n\n1. Create Postgres credential 'BizPilot n8n dedupe' (host postgres, db bizpilot, user n8n_dedupe, password from N8N_DEDUPE_DB_PASSWORD).\n2. Create Telegram credential 'BizPilot Telegram' with the bot token.\n3. Set n8n env: N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET, N8N_CALLBACK_SECRET, BIZPILOT_BASE_URL, TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.\n4. Replace REPLACE_WITH_* credential ids if n8n does not bind them on import.\n5. Import, activate, then verify with docs/N8N.md smoke steps.\n\nSee docs/N8N.md. Do not put secrets in this workflow JSON.",
